  "description": "GOBPUL crystallizes in the monoclinic crystal system with space group C 2/c. Reported CIF formula moiety: C100 H117 Eu4 Na1 O17 S8. From the CIF bond table, Eu1 (Eu) has 7 O neighbors; Eu2 (Eu) has 7 O neighbors; Eu3 (Eu) has 7 O neighbors; Eu4 (Eu) has 7 O neighbors. Oxygen-bridged metal-site graph: 6 pairs, 1 components; largest component is a network with cycles with approximately planar metal-site arrangement. Computed bridged metal-metal separations span 3.622-5.129 Å (not direct metal-metal bonds). Computed M-O-M angles span 89.89-180.00°; individual values and O labels are in metal_framework.links. Article card reports molecular formula C100H117Eu4NaO17S8. Explicit grouped units in the article formula/name: 1 μ4-OH (explicit grouped unit in article compound name (structural notation)).",
